    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "No matter how you do it, booking holidays can be a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "headache",
            "ref": "v-headache"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". It used to require a visit to a travel agent. Later, online travel agents appeared, allowing people to plan trips from the comfort of their own homes. Now, they are promising to handle the brainwork, too, with the help of AI. Expedia, for example, has introduced Romie, its “AI-powered travel buddy”. Trip.com has brought out TripGenie."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Many people expect AI to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "spare",
            "ref": "v-spare"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " them from boring tasks. This may explain why AI trip planners are drawing attention. They’re perfect for those who go mad when booking holidays."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "But are these AI booking agents reliable? Some have tried them out. When a couple asked TripGenie to find a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "romantic",
            "ref": "v-romantic"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " hotel in Paris, its top suggestion was by the airport. Well, perhaps the AI agent is still in its early days, they concluded."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Tools like TripGenie are facing competition from AI companies as well. OpenAI, for example, is testing its Operator. The AI bot is supposed to “"
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "mimic",
            "zh": "模仿"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " a human’s use of the Web”. When asked about that Paris trip, it suggests places with a view of the Eiffel Tower. Some researchers think OpenAI might soon "
          },
          {
            "t": "underline",
            "v": "disrupt"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the online travel agents’ market."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "One problem with AI booking agents is that they make mistakes. Air Canada got in trouble after its chatbot wrongly promised a user a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "discount",
            "ref": "v-discount"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Could AI agents be fooled into booking a more expensive flight? Would anyone feel safe giving their credit card information to an AI agent then?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "AI agents may also have difficulty understanding the endless variety of people’s tastes. Not everyone finds a pricey view of a metal tower romantic. One couple—the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "groom",
            "zh": "新郎"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " Icelandic and the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "bride",
            "zh": "新娘"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " French—recently got married on a flight between their countries. A hotel room by Paris Charles de Gaulle Airport might have suited them better."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
